  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting the capacity building of key Sustainable Land Management stakeholders to mainstream clima</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Addressing the lack of information on the impacts of climate change on the Land Degradation in Burundi, as well as (i) enhancing capacities and coordination mechanisms to efficiently mobilize funding dedicated to climate adaptation, notably for Sustainable Land Management, and (ii) lack of capacity and awareness on the impacts of climate change on Land Degradation in Burundi.</narrative>
  </description>
